What is Routing? 🚦

Routing means:

Directing a request, task, or user to the correct destination.

Just like road traffic is directed to different routes, in AI routing sends a task to the correct agent, tool, or process.

🤖 AI Agent Example

Suppose you have a Business Consultant AI with different agents:

                    👤 User Request
                          ↓
                    🚦 Router Agent
                          │
          ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
          ↓               ↓                ↓
     📈 Sales Agent   📢 Marketing Agent  💰 Finance Agent
Example 1

User asks:

"Why are my sales decreasing?"

The Router understands that this is related to sales:

User Question
      ↓
🚦 Router
      ↓
📈 Sales Agent
      ↓
Answer
